        "x0": 310.51,
        "top": 79.392,
        "x1": 357.591,
        "bottom": 89.352
      },
      "reading_order": 2,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0003",
      "text": "EXPLOSION HAZARD!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 108.298,
        "x1": 249.048,
        "bottom": 119.338
      },
      "reading_order": 3,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0004",
      "text": "FIRE HAZARD!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 133.498,
        "x1": 209.934,
        "bottom": 144.538
      },
      "reading_order": 4,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0005",
      "text": "DAMAGE TO THE PUMP SET!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 158.698,
        "x1": 286.919,
        "bottom": 169.738
      },
      "reading_order": 5,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0006",
      "text": "LEAKAGE OF HOT AND/OR TOXIC FLUIDS!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 183.898,
        "x1": 359.647,
        "bottom": 194.938
      },
      "reading_order": 6,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0007",
      "text": "Incorrectly serviced barrier fluid system will cause damage to the pump, death or serious",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 208.67,
        "x1": 513.17,
        "bottom": 217.67
      },
      "reading_order": 7,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0008",
      "text": "injury.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 221.03,
        "x1": 158.723,
        "bottom": 230.03
      },
      "reading_order": 8,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0009",
      "text": "Regularly service the barrier fluid system.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 243.47,
        "x1": 310.715,
        "bottom": 252.47
      },
      "reading_order": 9,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0010",
      "text": "Monitor the barrier fluid pressure.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 265.91,
        "x1": 276.119,
        "bottom": 274.91
      },
      "reading_order": 10,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0011",
      "text": "CAUTION",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 302.35,
        "top": 294.482,
        "x1": 353.933,
        "bottom": 304.442
      },
      "reading_order": 11,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0012",
      "text": "RISK OF PROPERTY DAMAGE!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 323.368,
        "x1": 295.525,
        "bottom": 334.408
      },
      "reading_order": 12,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0013",
      "text": "Dry running will cause increased wear to the pump",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 348.14,
        "x1": 349.145,
        "bottom": 357.14
      },
      "reading_order": 13,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0014",
      "text": "Do not operate the pump set without liquid fill.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 370.58,
        "x1": 330.119,
        "bottom": 379.58
      },
      "reading_order": 14,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0015",
      "text": "Do not close the shut-off element in the suction line and/or supply line during pump",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 393.02,
        "x1": 490.157,
        "bottom": 402.02
      },
      "reading_order": 15,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0016",
      "text": "operation.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 405.38,
        "x1": 175.292,
        "bottom": 414.38
      },
      "reading_order": 16,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0017",
      "text": "CAUTION",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 302.35,
        "top": 433.922,
        "x1": 353.933,
        "bottom": 443.882
      },
      "reading_order": 17,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0018",
      "text": "RISK OF PROPERTY DAMAGE!",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 462.828,
        "x1": 295.525,
        "bottom": 473.868
      },
      "reading_order": 18,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0019",
      "text": "Too high temperature of fluid handled could damage the pump.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 487.6,
        "x1": 402.341,
        "bottom": 496.6
      },
      "reading_order": 19,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0020",
      "text": "Do not operate the pump against a closed shut-off element for long periods.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 510.04,
        "x1": 456.814,
        "bottom": 519.04
      },
      "reading_order": 20,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0021",
      "text": "Observe the temperature limits in the section on operating limits. (chapter 2.8.4)",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 131.66,
        "top": 532.48,
        "x1": 473.977,
        "bottom": 541.48
      },
      "reading_order": 21,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0022",
      "text": "While the pump is in operation, observe and check the following:",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 565.428,
        "x1": 357.013,
        "bottom": 576.468
      },
      "reading_order": 22,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0023",
      "text": "• The pump must run quietly and free from vibrations at all times.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 590.508,
        "x1": 368.752,
        "bottom": 601.548
      },
      "reading_order": 23,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0024",
      "text": "• Check the shaft seal.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 614.508,
        "x1": 163.888,
        "bottom": 625.548
      },
      "reading_order": 24,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0025",
      "text": "• Check the static seals for leakage.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 638.418,
        "x1": 228.86,
        "bottom": 649.458
      },
      "reading_order": 25,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0026",
      "text": "• Check the rolling element bearings for running noises.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 662.418,
        "x1": 324.146,
        "bottom": 673.458
      },
      "reading_order": 26,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0027",
      "text": "Vibrations, noise and an increased incurrent input occurring during unchanged operating",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 687.258,
        "x1": 473.291,
        "bottom": 698.298
      },
      "reading_order": 27,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0028",
      "text": "conditions indicate wear.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 706.218,
        "x1": 163.756,
        "bottom": 717.258
      },
      "reading_order": 28,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0029",
      "text": "• Monitor the correct functioning of any auxiliary connections.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 731.418,
        "x1": 350.539,
        "bottom": 742.458
      },
      "reading_order": 29,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP005:p0067:b0030",
      "text": "• Monitor the stand-by pump.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 43.2,
        "top": 755.294,
        "x1": 195.099,
        "bottom": 766.334
      },
      "reading_order": 30,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
